WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
Each research finding should
change a design decision.

00:00:02.987 --> 00:00:07.360
If generation shifts work into review,
measure total workflow effort.

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:11.760
If passing tests can still be weak,
add independent quality checks.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:14.800
If behavior changes
with configuration and use,

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:17.920
retain versions and feed
failures into evaluation.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:23.360
If tools increase the impact of errors,
enforce authority outside the model.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:28.000
The evidence we retain should make
each of these decisions inspectable.
